// M7d scenario (M5 setting plus a Blue 155 mm battery on call): a Blue tank platoon pair holds a village crossroads against a Red tank company
// attacking from the north-east. Play as Blue: occupy battle positions (B), set weapons
// control, and hold the objective until the time limit. The Blue AI plan is used only when
// the side is not player-controlled (headless runs, tests).
