    seed: 5,
    briefing: "SITUATION: A RED TANK COMPANY IS EXPECTED FROM THE NORTH-EAST AT FIRST LIGHT. A 155 MM BATTERY (ARTY 1) IS IN DIRECT SUPPORT, 4 KM SOUTH-WEST OF THE VILLAGE.\n\nMISSION: 1ST AND 2ND PLATOONS HOLD THE VILLAGE CROSSROADS FOR 45 MINUTES. RED WINS BY HOLDING THE VILLAGE UNCONTESTED FOR 2 MINUTES. A SIDE THAT LOSES 70 % OF ITS TANKS LOSES.\n\nNOTES: CALL FOR FIRE (Y) ON THE RED AXIS OF ADVANCE: THE FDC NEEDS ABOUT A MINUTE, THEN ROUNDS FLY FOR 20-40 S. ALLOW FOR THAT. HE SUPPRESSES AND HURTS LIGHT VEHICLES MORE THAN TANKS. SMOKE ROUNDS (Y AGAIN) SCREEN A POSITION. USE THE PLANNING PHASE. OCCUPY BATTLE POSITIONS (B) FACING NE, DRAW A PHASE LINE, THEN EXECUTE (ENTER).",
